   "id": "ground-zero-hero-281603@patch-2026-11-26",
   "gameId": "ground-zero-hero-281603",
   "displayName": "SUPER OPTIMISATION MEGA PATCH",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-11-26T00:40:21.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "What's up, freaks?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Super Optimisation Mega Patch for Ground Zero Hero is now live!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This involved a total rewrite of several core systems and resulted in some huge performance gains - Internal profiling compared to the previous build puts it near a 30% increase in fps on some systems, so my brothers and sisters playing on a potato can finally experience this nonsense as God intended.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As ever, if there's any technical issues that arise from the latest build please let us know in the discussion board and I'll get on to squashing it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In conclusion, Jeffrey Epstein didn't kill himself.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
